Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:07.46,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:11.73,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(2012.893,200.557)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:15.98,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(2012.893,200.557)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:13.97,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Hello everybody i don't often make videos on Windows builds but it's one of those times when I'm just disappointed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:19.93,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,The new Windows 11 beta build changes the blue screen of death to show even less information
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:26.36,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and then on top of that removes the essential oobe\bypassNRO script
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:29.07,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,See it's no longer found
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:35.42,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,For those of you who aren't familiar the oobe\bypassNRO script
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:41.07,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,helped you bypass the network requirements inside the out-of-box experience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:44.40,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,as you can see the script makes the computer reboot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:48.58,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and pass the reboot it's not going to ask you to connect to the internet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.91,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So that you can create a local account
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:55.11,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and avoid the forced Microsoft account requirement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:59.74,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it's the fallback copy here but doesn't really matter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:04.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so technically if you're an ordinary grandma that knows nothing about Windows
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:09.30,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,or even slightly more technology proficient user that knows
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.39,0:01:15.38,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,how to search things online you can no longer install Windows without connecting to the internet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:19.41,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and connecting it with the godforsaken Microsoft account
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:27.67,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it looks like I've lost my internet connection and I cannot continue
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:34.98,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Let's see what our blog has to say about these two drastic design changes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:40.03,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,here's the official Microsoft blog post on the newest beta build we're talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:44.57,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,here they list the entire change log but we're more particularly interested in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:49.57,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,how they describe the change of the bug check and the removal of the bypass NRO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:52.71,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so let's go ahead and read that out loud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:03.28,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,we're previewing a new more streamlined UI for unexpected restarts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:06.06,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,which better aligns with Windows 11 design principles
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:10.44,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and supports our goal of getting users back into productivity as fast as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.97,0:02:12.65,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,look how they sugarcoat it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:17.21,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,we've simplified your experience while preserving the technical information on the screen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:20.98,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,as a reminder for Windows Insiders this appears as a green screen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:24.40,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,No nothing new here this is beginning to roll out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:26.88,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Windows Insiders on Windows 11 version
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.21,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,24H2 and higher in the beta dev and canary channels
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:37.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Here's how that looks they stripped the bug check of the said smiley and the QR code
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:46.33,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and the rest seems pretty much the same I got to say I actually hate the word streamlined
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:51.05,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it's basically become a euphemism for stripping the features away from the user
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:56.16,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean I wouldconsider the QR code a feature of sorts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:59.62,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,because I mean it looked more friendly to the user
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:05.08,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,this looks kind of threatening it has a threatening aura if you know what I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:09.36,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,not everything needs to be streamlined that's my point especially
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:12.55,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,not the screen that shows you important debug information
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:16.94,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,pretty disappointing Microsoft another horrible pointless change
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.36,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,well we have no control over that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:22.99,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,but what's happening to Windows lately is absolute cinema
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.22,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I have nothing else to say about it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:30.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I'll read the announcement of the next change directly from the blog as well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:33.88,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,See what they haveto say about the bypassNRO script
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:39.28,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,we're removing the bypassnro.cmd script from the build to enhance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.59,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,security and user experience of Windows 11
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:46.79,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,this change ensures that all users exit setup with an internet connectivity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:52.73,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and a Microsoft account you lovely saints thank you for enhancing my security
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:55.98,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,aka forcing me to connect my computer to the internet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:04:01.11,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and enhancing my user experience aka forcing me to log into the Microsoft account
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:06.84,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I cannot express my frustration with the gaslighting that's happening in this blog post
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:14.20,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't want a Microsoft account and what if that's an offline computer that's only connected to the local area network
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:16.60,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,because this is my computer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:21.34,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and it's security and user experience is my concern and none of your business
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:25.64,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,get the hell off my face with this stupid forced Microsoft account BS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:32.85,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,also do you hear that these dogs are out of control
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:42.03,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't get the new blue screen to show up no matter which branch I downloaded the build from
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:46.49,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,but I don't think it's anything special that can't be shown in a single frame
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.20,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,just want to let you know I couldn't get it to work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:52.14,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,for some reason i've been trying for like the past two days
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:55.20,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,in theory the new bug check should be available in the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:05:00.36,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,beta dev and canary builds with a feature ID 50070238
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.64,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and ideally you should be able
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:04.37,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,to turn it on using Vive tool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:09.14,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,My attempts failed and the feature flag reset leaving me with the old bug check
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.70,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean we have the screenshots
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:15.66,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Imagine though it's an early April Fool's joke or something and that's the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.54,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I can't reproduce that right now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.29,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,that'd be super funny
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:25.03,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,anyway that's a slightly more simplified version of the current bug check without a smiley
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:26.54,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,rest in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:29.95,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and it's also going to be black in production builds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:38.05,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,yet again meaning BSOD yet again stands for the black screen of death instead of blue screen of death
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:43.20,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,whatever man can't wait to see them reverted again a couple builds later
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.39,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,as for the bypass and the rose script
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.71,0:05:49.57,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it was a script after all so let's go ahead and examine the contents of it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:52.46,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,to learn what exactly it used to do on the older builds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:01.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,looks like nothing much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:07.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,So first of all it silences the output of the batch script using the at echo off macro
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:15.33,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,then it adds a registry value called BypassNRO with a type registry dword
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:17.10,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and sets it to one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:19.95,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,inside the OOBE key
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:28.92,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,then it restarts the computer pretty simple
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:34.29,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,that's all it does let's see if it works on the newer version of Windows
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:37.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,okay we're back on the newest version of Windows 11
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:41.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,let's verify that by showing the version
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:45.84,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,right here 26120
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.88,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,script no longer works it just doesn't exist
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.86,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,let's go ahead and verify there's no internet connection present
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.52,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,by skimming through the first part of the oobe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:09.96,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,let's connect you to a network and there is no option to skip the network check
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:17.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,now let's open the registry editor then find the key
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:31.78,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,let's create a new dword value called bypassNRO
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:35.32,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,set it to one very nice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:41.88,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and then restart we have basically manually reproduced the script
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:47.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,have they turned it off in the out of box experience let's find out
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:53.15,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,oh wow you still have the button huge
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:59.74,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so the only thing they did was to remove the BypassNRO script
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.69,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,but the registry setting is still present
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:07.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,which is actually great great news
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:13.17,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,now it's going to take them another six months to remove the registry value from the oobe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:20.58,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah you can still bypass the network requirements
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:23.64,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,even though the script is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:27.28,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,got to turn all this garbage off
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.05,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,before proceeding all right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:33.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:36.50,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:41.38,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,another trick you guys can employ to bypass the network requirements
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:47.92,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,is using the protocol commands basically the out of box experience application
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:49.64,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,provides us a protocol
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.84,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and there are a couple commands they have implemented
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:55.82,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and some of them remain from Windows 10
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:09:00.30,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I showed off many of these commands in a video from like a year ago
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:04.04,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,experimenting on the out of box experience application
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:10.10,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,that's also when I found there is a developer console in the in the oobe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:14.68,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,wait did they fix it wait it doesn't work anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:21.00,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,used to be able to press control shift J and open up the developer console
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.11,0:09:25.29,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,wow I think they removed it from production finally
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:32.58,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,anyway the protocol this application provides is called ms-cxh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.87,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and you can run commands using start
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:46.30,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and then input your command and one of those commands is local only
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:52.68,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,whenever you run that it opens a dialogue box
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:55.98,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,to create a user for this computer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.25,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,we can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:01.32,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,name our user and add a password
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:06.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,the security questions are also on the same page which which is pretty nice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:08.61,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I should say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:14.33,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,that's um that's also a piece of a fallback oobe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:18.76,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,you can break this application to run that as well
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:21.22,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,let's go ahead and click next
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:27.08,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and it just basically skips the entire out of box experience and we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:29.82,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,super super nice but
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:34.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,the only downside to that is you'll be faced with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:38.12,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,a second chance obby as they call it SC oobe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:43.20,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,which will pest you to choose privacy settings and what not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:49.88,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and you just accept it once and you move on with your day
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:54.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,anyway I hope you enjoyed the video i certainly am not enjoying Microsoft
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:56.22,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,going down the rogue path
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:11:00.24,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,preparing the users for a forced Microsoft account integration
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:04.80,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,luckily this is not possible to achieve with the current Windows architecture
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:08.31,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,the local users are pretty much baked into the system
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:11.40,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and I don't see how they're going to police this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:15.78,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,but the trend is quite obvious i'm a big fan of Windows personally
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:20.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,but damn Linux for personal use is looking real hot right now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.15,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,that's it thanks for watching take care
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:13.97,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,大家好，我不常做关于Windows构建的视频，但这次真是让我失望透顶的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:19.93,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,Windows 11新测试版更新进一步简化蓝屏死机显示信息
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:26.36,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,除此之外，还移除了关键的oobe\bypassNRO脚本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:29.07,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,看到了吗，它不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:35.42,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,对于那些不熟悉oobe\bypassNRO脚本的人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:41.07,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这个会帮你在开箱体验中绕过网络要求
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:44.40,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,正如你所见，这个脚本会导致电脑重启
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:48.58,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,重启后不会要求你连接互联网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:50.91,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这样你就可以创建本地账户了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:55.11,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,避免强制要求使用微软账户
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:59.74,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这是备用方案，不过无关紧要了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:04.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,所以严格来说，如果你是个对Windows一窍不通的普通老奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:09.30,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,甚至是稍微懂点技术的用户都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.39,0:01:15.38,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,如何在线搜索东西，你现在不连接互联网就无法安装Windows
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:19.41,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,还要把它和那个该死的微软账户关联起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:27.67,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来我的网络连接断了，我无法继续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:34.98,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,来看看我们的博客对这两项重大设计变更有何见解
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:40.03,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这是我们讨论的最新测试版官方Microsoft博客文章
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:44.57,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这里列出了完整的变更日志，但我们更特别感兴趣的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:49.57,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,他们如何描述漏洞检查的变更及绕过NRO机制的移除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:52.71,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,那么我们就大声读出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:03.28,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我们正在预览一个针对意外重启设计的更简洁的新用户界面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:06.06,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,更符合Windows 11的设计原则
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:10.44,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,并支持我们让用户尽快恢复高效工作的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.97,0:02:12.65,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,看看他们是怎么粉饰的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:17.21,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我们在简化您体验的同时，保留了屏幕上的技术信息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:20.98,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,为了提醒Windows Insider用户，这会显示为绿屏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:24.40,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这里没什么新消息。这正开始向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:26.88,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,Windows 11版本的Windows Insiders推出
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.21,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,Beta dev 和 canary 通道中的24H2及更高版本
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:37.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是他们如何移除了所说的笑脸和二维码的错误检查
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:46.33,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,其余的看起来几乎没什么差别，我得说我真的很讨厌 “流水线” 这个词
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:51.05,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这基本上成了剥夺用户功能的委婉说法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:56.16,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我的意思是，我认为二维码也算是一种特色功能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:59.62,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,因为我觉得这对用户看起来更友好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:05.08,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这看起来有点威胁性，它散发着一种威胁的气场，如果你明白我的意思的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:09.36,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,不是所有事情都需要流水线化，这正是我的观点所在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:12.55,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,不是显示重要调试信息的那个屏幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:16.94,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,相当令人失望，微软又一次做出了毫无意义的糟糕改动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.36,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧，我们对那件事无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:22.99,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,但Windows最近的动态简直像在上演大片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.22,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,关于这件事，我无话可说了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:30.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我也会直接从博客上宣读下一个变更的公告
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:33.88,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,看看他们对绕过NRO脚本有什么看法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:39.28,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我们将从构建中移除bypassnro.cmd脚本以增强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.59,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,Windows 11的安全性与用户体验
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:46.79,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这一更改确保所有用户在完成设置时具备互联网连接
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:52.73,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,还有微软账户，你们这些可爱的圣人，感谢你们提升了我的安全性
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:55.98,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是逼我把电脑连上网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:04:01.11,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,以及提升我的用户体验，也就是强迫我登录微软账户
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:06.84,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我无法表达对这篇博文中出现的煤气灯效应感到的沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:14.20,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我不想使用微软账户，如果那是一台仅连接到局域网的离线电脑怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:16.60,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,因为这是我的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:21.34,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,它的安全性和用户体验是我关心的事，与你无关
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:25.64,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,带着你这强制登录微软账户的废话滚出我的视线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:32.85,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你有没有听说这些狗已经失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:42.03,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,无论我从哪个分支下载构建版本，都没法让新的蓝屏界面显示出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:46.49,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,但我并不觉得这有什么特别之处，特别到无法用一帧画面来展现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.20,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,只是想告诉你我没能搞定它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:52.14,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,不知为何，我这两天一直在尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:55.20,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,理论上新的错误检查应该会在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:05:00.36,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,具有功能ID 50070238的Beta dev和 canary 版本
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.64,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,理想情况下,你应该能够
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:04.37,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,使用Vive工具来开启它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:09.14,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我的尝试失败了，功能标志被重置，让我又回到了旧的错误检查状态
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.70,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说我们有截图
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:15.66,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,想象一下，这或许是四月初的一个愚人节玩笑之类的，所以才是这个原因
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.54,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我现在无法复现那个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.29,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,那会超级搞笑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:25.03,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,总之，这是当前错误检查的一个稍微简化的版本，没有笑脸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:26.54,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,安息 ╯︿╰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:29.95,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,并且在生产版本中它也会是黑色的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:38.05,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,又一次意味着BSOD，这里的yet again代表黑屏死机而非蓝屏死机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:43.20,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,随便吧，反正等不及要看它们在几个版本后又被改回来的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.39,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,至于跳过脚本
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.71,0:05:49.57,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这毕竟是个脚本，那么我们就来看看它的内容吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:52.46,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,了解它在旧版本中具体用来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:01.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来也没有多少东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:07.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,首先，它通过使用echo off宏来静默批处理脚本的输出
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:15.33,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,然后它会添加一个名为BypassNRO的注册表值，类型为REG_DWORD
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:17.10,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,并且设为1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:19.95,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,路径是在oobe（看视频不是看这里啦）  (/▽＼)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:28.92,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,然后它会重启电脑，非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:34.29,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是它的全部功能，我们来看看它在较新版本的Windows上是否能用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:37.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,好的，我们回到了最新版的Windows 11
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:41.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,让我们通过显示版本来验证这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:45.84,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,就在这 26120
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.88,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,脚本不再有效，它根本不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.86,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,让我们继续验证当前没有互联网连接
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.52,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,浏览oobe的第一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:09.96,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,让我们为您连接到网络，且无法跳过网络检查
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:17.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,现在让我们打开注册表编辑器，然后找到该键值
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:31.78,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,让我们创建一个名为bypassNRO的新DWORD值
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:35.32,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,把它设为1，好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:41.88,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,然后重启，我们基本上已经手动复制了这个脚本
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:47.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,他们在开箱体验中关掉了吗？让我们一探究竟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:53.15,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,哇哦，你的按钮居然还这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:59.74,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,所以他们唯一做的就是移除了BypassNRO脚本
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.69,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,但注册表设置仍然存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:07.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这是个天大的好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:13.17,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,现在他们还需要六个月才能从OOBE中移除注册表值
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:20.58,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,是的，你仍然可以绕过网络要求
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:23.64,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管脚本已不复存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:27.28,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,得把这些垃圾都关掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.05,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,在进行之前，好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:33.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我们进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:36.50,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,太美
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:41.38,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你们可以用来绕过网络要求的另一个技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:47.92,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,是使用协议命令，基本上是开箱即用的体验应用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:49.64,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,提供了一个协议
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.84,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,他们已经实现了几个命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:55.82,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,其中一些仍保留自Windows 10
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:09:00.30,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,大约一年前的一个视频里我就展示过很多这些命令
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:04.04,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,在开箱即用体验应用上进行实验
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:10.10,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是在那时我发现OOBE界面里有个开发者控制台
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:14.68,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,等等，他们修好了吗？它又不能用了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:21.00,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,过去可以按Ctrl+Shift+J打开开发者控制台
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.11,0:09:25.29,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,哇，我觉得他们终于把它从生产环境中移除了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:32.58,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,无论如何，这个应用程序提供的协议称为ms-cxh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.87,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你可以使用start来运行命令（看视频操作啦）  ~(￣▽￣)~*
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:46.30,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,然后输入你的命令，其中有一个命令仅限本地使用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:52.68,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,每次运行它都会弹出一个对话框
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:55.98,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,为此计算机创建用户
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.25,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我们可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:01.32,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,命名账户和设置密码
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:06.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,安全问题也在同一页面上，这相当不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:08.61,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我应该说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:14.33,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这个也是备用的OOBE的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:18.76,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你可以破坏这个应用程序来运行它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:21.22,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我们继续点击下一步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:27.08,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,它基本上直接跳过了整个开箱体验，我们就直接进入了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:29.82,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,超级超级棒但是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:34.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,唯一的缺点是你将面临
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:38.12,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,第二个要求页面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:43.20,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这会让你烦恼地去选择隐私设置之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:49.88,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你就接受一次然后继续过你的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:54.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,无论如何，希望你喜欢这个视频，反正我是一点都不享受微软的体验
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:56.22,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,走上堕落之路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:11:00.24,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,为用户强制整合Microsoft账户做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:04.80,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,幸运的是，以目前的Windows架构无法实现这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:08.31,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,本地用户几乎已深植于系统之中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:11.40,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我看不出他们打算如何监管这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:15.78,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,但趋势相当明显，我个人是Windows的忠实粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:20.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,但说真的，Linux现在对个人用户来说简直香到不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.15,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,就这样，感谢观看，生活愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:20.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1917.823,253.357)}原标题：Windows 11 Never Stops Disappointing (And Fixing It) 原作者：Enderman
